The product ordered at Tsukumo net shop was arbitrarily replaced
Summary: When I ordered a wireless mouse that had become cheaper, I received a wired version of that mouse, and I was told to send it back if I wanted a refund
It is a mail-order trouble rather than the topic of a self-made PC, but no matter how you think about it, you will not be convinced and it is a well-known place, so I will write it here.
MSI's wireless gaming mouse was sold for 3,280yen (linked Uotaku) at Tsukumo Day sale of Tsukumo net shop starting from the previous Friday
Since the wired version was the same price at the store, considering the possibility of the price mistake and checking the wired version page, it was 5,071yen (linked Uotaku), so I ordered it considering the possibility that it was not a mistake
I successfully received an order e-mail, and I also received a shipping e-mail the next day
"CLUTCH GM41 LIGHTWEIGHT WIRELESS" was written in these two e-mails and the purchase history of My Page
Since there was no error communication or cancellation notice from the order to the shipment, I thought at this point when the wireless mouse I ordered arrived
A few hours after the shipment, I received an e-mail saying "There was a mistake in the registration of the product".
According to the e-mail,
* The wireless version was sold at the sale special price, but it was actually a wired version
* Since the wired mouse has already been shipped,
1. Refuse to receive and completely cancel
2. Returns only the mouse and get a refund
3. Use a wired mouse as it is
i'll choose to deal with it.
The product page of the wired version and the wireless version are divided, and it is written as a wireless version in the purchase history, e-mail, and delivery slip, but it seems to have been sent arbitrarily replaced with the wired version
Isn't it terrible that you can send something that is different from the product you bought without your understanding, and if you want it to be refunded, you can send it back from here?
In the end, even if you accept a refund, you want to fight back with one shot, so please lend your wisdom
