Experiencing Paramarathon in VR (TOKYO MX) - Yahoo! News
On December 12, 2021, the Tokyo Metropolitan Government held an event in which you can run the marathon course of the Paralympics, which was recreated digitally.
This event was held so that you can experience the new enjoyment of sports and the charm of Tokyo's tourism through digital.
Running machines and road bikes were prepared at the venue, and people who visited the venue were speeding along the Paralympic marathon course that was recreated in a virtual space with dedicated equipment.
In each tablet where the virtual space is projected, your own avatar will appear, and you can have an experience as if you are competing while running on a marathon course with participants from Japan and overseas, and you can also enjoy sightseeing spots in Tokyo.
Participant ... “The scenery was very different and it was a lot of fun.”
"It's really fun to be able to run while running through the streets of Tokyo, but it's really fun to be able to run while having fun, and I'm glad that I was able to do my best until the end while competing with everyone."
