The body of a man was found in Shonai River in Moriyama-ku, Nagoya (Chukyo TV NEWS) - Yahoo! News
Just before noon on the 12th, a man was found lying face down and dying in Shonai-gawa River in Moriyama Ward, Nagoya City.
Police are still trying to determine the man’s identity and cause of death.
According to the police, just before 11:30am on the twelfth on the 12th, a passer-by found a man lying face down in the Shonai-gawa River in Nakashidanmi, Moriyama Ward, and called the 110th.
The man was rescued from the river but was pronounced dead on the spot.
The police are rushing to confirm his identity and determine the cause of death.
On the other hand, a man in his 70s in Sunagawa in Fukuoka-cho, Okazaki City, was found lying in the river and was confirmed dead.
There was no turbulence in the man’s clothes, but a bicycle collapsed nearby.
