How to find Stol A new way (Sankei Shimbun) - Yahoo! News
It is an indispensable stall in the winter, but isn't there a time when the fabric clings around the neck?
It is good to adjust the balance while looking in the mirror after it is rolled, but there are times when you hear that you do not understand the tricks.
When I thought that if there was a stall where the cloth could not be bothered and it could be rolled quickly, I found something innovative.
"COTOTTORI" is a more compact size than the general one with a long side of about one meter.
When I first saw it, I was like, "Can it be rolled so short?"
If you look closely, you can see that it is made into a single piece by knitting a thin-skinned cloth, and the whole is in the shape of a net.
In the eyes of the net, the edge of the stole can pass through.
Therefore, it can be wrapped and fastened without tying the edges and edges together.
It is very light and warm with fleece material.
This year's gilet (bests) without sleeves are popular even in jackets, but there are many people who wear it in combination with a stole so that their shoulders do not get cold.
I think it would be useful to have such a stole.
