To Kinnikuman, “Don’t depend only on the strength of God’s luck!”
That's the line.
This is already a magnificent meta-reconference for the work itself, I think that the reader so far has felt that Kinnikuman is the main character after all, so he does not lose because he is the main character, and he is somehow winning in a place where it is not a power.
However, by letting the ramen man make this remark, boiled egg-sensei got ahead of himself and stabbed the keg so he couldn't use his hands anymore.
