The number of people infected with the new coronavirus in the military has increased by thirty ... all breakthrough infections = South Korea (WoW! Korea) - Yahoo! News
The number of new coronavirus cases in the South Korean military increased by thirty from the previous day.
All of the newly infected people were cases of breakthrough infection.
South Korea's Ministry of National Defense announced that the total number of new coronavirus infections in the military increased from the previous day to 2713, an increase of 30 from the previous day.
Sixty-six were members of the Army, including six members of the Navy, six members of the Air Force, and two other troops.
Among the cumulative infections, there are three hundred and sixty-six patients who are currently undergoing treatment and management, and the number of cumulative number of breakthrough infections on this day's standard has increased to 977people.
